    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SARA: This car's only a thousand. No that's just for tires.\nMARGOT: Great. I can't even afford tires.\nSARA: Here's one without tires.\nMARGOT: We've looked everywhere, we're not gonna find anything.",
      "MARGOT: I just know my mom would've wanted me to fight to keep this house.\nSARA: I say you do what you need to do.\nMARGOT: Hey, it would be the fastest way to get a car.",
      "MARGOT: Thanks for the ride. I love you, Gus.\nSARA: Love you, Gus.\nSARA: No, you stay back there.",
      "ALLISON: So, Margot, tell us about yourself. Where are you from?\nMARGOT: Here, actually. Born and raised.\nALLISON: A local! Well I'm jealous. You get to live in paradise all year long.",
      "MARGOT: I thought I recognized a few of them.\nALLISON: She's funny!\nMARGOT: Wow, that is some good cheese."
    ]
